      399.12,
      310.06,
      445.19
    ],
    "text": "I, hereby give notice under Sub-Section (1) of Section 7 of theLand Acquisition Act, No. 28 of 1964 (Amendment) that theGovernment intends to acquire the following land which isrequired for a public purpose.",
    "fonts": [
      "TimesNewRomanPSMT"
    ],
