  {
    "page_number": 0,
    "bbox": [
      70.08,
      483.12,
      310.05,
      553.19
    ],
    "text": "An allotment of land in total extent of about 0.7669 hectaredepicted as Lot 01 in the Preliminary Plan No. MR/2742, situatedin the village called Naotunna in Naotunna North GramaNiladari Division in the Divisional Secretary's Division ofDevinuwara in Matara District of the Southern Province andmore fully described as follows.",
    "fonts": [
      "TimesNewRomanPSMT"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      10.070419311523438
    ]
  },
  {
    "page_number": 0,
    "bbox": [
      70.08,
      567.12,
      309.68,
      613.19
    ],
    "text": "01. Lot No. 1Name of land: Paragahadeniyewatta, Hettigamagewatta,Paragahahenawatta and Paragahadeniyahena; Description:Home garden and a mix cultivation available; Claimant by:",
